-- ==========================================
-- MOVEMENT SCRIPT v11
-- ==========================================
-- NEW IN v11:
--   1. Arena check         - bot only activates when standing on the map cylinder
--   2. Landing prediction  - simulates WHERE the player lands and checks if the
--                            laser will be there at that future time. Refuses to
--                            jump if landing zone is unsafe.
--   3. Angular velocity    - lasers rotate (pivot), not just translate. CFrame
--                            delta now extracts angular sweep velocity so rotating
--                            beams are predicted correctly.
--   4. Jump gate           - only fires jump if player is actually moving TOWARD
--                            the laser (prevents accidental jumps while backing away)
--   5. Strafe logic        - walks parallel to the laser face while waiting for
--                            a clean jump window instead of charging straight in.
--   6. Multi-laser TTI     - picks the laser with lowest time-to-impact, not just
--                            closest by distance.
--   7. Survival HUD        - ScreenGui showing run timer + jump counter
--   8. Arc danger colors   - green / orange (tight) / red (unsafe)
-- ==========================================
print("[Movement] v11 loaded")

